    {
      "_id": "I6lho1IX0UheiBCu",
      "name": "Savant",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
      "system": {
        "category": "calling",
        "identifier": "calling-savant",
        "source": "Callings",
        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "savant",
          "mind"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"It's not obscure. You just haven't read it.\"</em></p><p><strong>Savant</strong> is the Mind Calling \u2014 the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: scholar, engineer, medic, archivist, detective, translator. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack \u2014 Library-Brain:</strong> Lore and Investigation checks never fumble; identifies items of tier \u2264 own tier on sight (at Tier III, including technomagical origin).</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Lore</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Investigation</strong> rank = tier \u2212 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Economy or Soft Power (GM picks by job)</strong> marks. Cross-pool \u00d71.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice \u2192 Initiate \u2192 Master \u2192 Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Wyrdlens Adept or Cosmic Linguist. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path \u2014 Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
